  "content_scope": "Selected rendered lines for the 1998 Trade Please campaign, its February 10 to July 31 campaign window, mail-in trade mechanic, three course structure, and the four source-pinned campaign card identities. This snapshot is not a full campaign archive, not a complete flyer or envelope variant catalog, not a fulfillment ledger, not an official copy-count authority, and not a raw HTML snapshot.",
